  "scope": "For every actual owned Overworld sampler, ColumnRequest and U32 budget, O.sample_column returns the exact complete sampler. The sampler includes its whole retained Plan and all BlendedNoise permutation arrays. This covers admitted real loop sampling and refused requests; it does not establish density numerical parity, output length, coordinate admissibility, final terrain generation, biome selection or material population.",
